## .NET
bin/
obj/
*.user

## Solution/build artifacts
TestResults/
*.trx

## Local dev server logs (written by scripts/setup.sh / setup.ps1)
app.log
app.err.log

## SQLite database
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

## Uploaded files (user content, not source)
src/AcmeCatalog.Web/wwwroot/uploads/*
!src/AcmeCatalog.Web/wwwroot/uploads/.gitkeep

## OS / editor
.DS_Store
.vs/
.vscode/
*.swp

## Claude Code local settings (machine-specific, not shared)
.claude/settings.local.json

## Secrets / local env overrides
appsettings.*.local.json
*.env
.env

## Node (Cypress + clientapp)
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
# Two Cypress projects live below repo root (src/AcmeCatalog.Web/cypress and
# .../clientapp/cypress) — a bare "cypress/results/" pattern is anchored to
# the .gitignore's own directory (it contains a mid-path slash) and silently
# never matched either one. **/ makes it depth-agnostic.
**/cypress/videos/
**/cypress/screenshots/
**/cypress/downloads/
**/cypress/results/

## Generated dashboard output — scripts/metrics/generate-dashboard.mjs
## writes here; only the generator is source, never its output.
scripts/metrics/dist/

## clientapp (React) build output — generated by `npm run build`,
## served from wwwroot but not itself source
src/AcmeCatalog.Web/wwwroot/clientapp-dist/

## JMeter (future performance-test phase)
*.jtl
jmeter.log
